orate+Agreement.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table class="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Dear &lt; Insert personalisation &gt;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Please see attached approval from &lt; insert name &gt; from &lt; insert company &gt; to provide raw travel data to facilitate a potential Qantas Corporate Airfare Agreement.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Can we please request a data report, advising the ticketed amount spent on air travel, for the last 12 months of travel for &lt; insert company &gt;. The following details are required for Point of Sale of origin Australia for the travel period &lt; 01 Month YY to 31 Month YY &gt; and should include:</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><ul style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li style="line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Base fare (exclusive of tax) if this is not possible please state if they include taxes or not</li><li style="line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Whether the travel was regional, domestic or international</li><li style="line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Destination travelled to and from</li><li style="line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Fare class the ticket was booked in (e.g. Economy class Y/B/H or Business class J/C etc.)</li><li style="line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Airline flown - showing QF for Qantas and YY for privacy reasons for all other airlines</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">For privacy reasons, please omit traveller names or sensitive information in the reporting.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Once the data is received, I will be in touch with &lt; insert company &gt; and yourself with next steps.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Thank you in advance for your assistance.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Kind regards,</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="